    {"symbol": "⚖️", "tooltip": "A signature names the pen-holder; fiduciary substance-over-form names whoever actually owed the duty — so renaming the act renames nothing."},
    {"symbol": "🔓", "tooltip": "Open verification math is a key that fits no lock when the record stays sealed and the discovery hook is gone."}
  ],
